<title>GERMANY: ATHLETICS-EVOLUTION OF THE WOMEN'S HAMMER WORLD RECORD.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-EVOLUTION OF THE WOMEN'S HAMMER WORLD RECORD.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Evolution of the women's hammer</p>
<p>world record broken by Olga Kuzenkova of Russia at the European</p>
<p>Cup on Sunday (tabulate under - distance, name, nationality,</p>
<p>date):</p>
<p> 66.84 metres   Olga Kuzenkova  (Russia)     23.2.94</p>
<p> 66.86	    Mihaela Melinte (Romania)     6.3.95</p>
<p> 68.14	    Kuzenkova			   5.6.95</p>
<p> 68.16	    Kuzenkova			  18.6.95</p>
<p> 69.00	    Melinte			    22.2.97</p>
<p> 69.58	    Melinte			     8.3.97</p>
<p> 73.10	    Kuzenkova			  22.6.97</p>
